# Encumbered Reejerey (5/4): "This creature enters with three -1/-1 counters on it" (a 2/1) and "Whenever this creature becomes
# tapped while it has a -1/-1 counter on it, remove a -1/-1 counter from it". Bot1 attacks with it on turns 3, 5 and 7, each
# attack removing one counter (3/2, 4/3, 5/4); on turn 9 it has none, so tapping it removes nothing.

